    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d489">

                <pb facs="0614" n="534" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg534"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-12-29"><hi rendition="#italic">December 29,
                        1900</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 538.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a statement
                    from Mr. Russell in reference to the arrest and imprisonment of our consular
                    agent at Barcelona, who is not a citizen of this country, but a Danish subject.
                    Mr. Russell says that no apology was ever made to Mr. Balz, and that his
                    telegram to him, filed with the Government telegraph company here, was never
                    delivered. Mr. Balz has been imprisoned before without cause and made to pay
                    forced loans to local military leaders.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis B.
                    Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d489-a1.xml" xpointer="d489-a1"/>
            </div>
